      <h4>Managed By</h4>
      <p><a href="https://aws.amazon.com/"><img src="/img/logos/amazon-web-services-logo.png" class="managed-by-logo" alt="Amazon Web Services"></a></p>
      <p>See all datasets managed by <a href="https://registry.opendata.aws?search&#x3D;managedBy:amazon web services">Amazon Web Services</a>.</p>

      <h4>Contact</h4>
      <p><a href="mailto:aws-blockchain-data@amazon.com">&#x61;&#x77;&#115;&#45;&#x62;&#108;&#x6f;&#x63;&#107;&#x63;&#104;&#97;&#105;&#110;&#x2d;&#x64;&#x61;&#116;&#x61;&#64;&#x61;&#x6d;&#x61;&#122;&#111;&#x6e;&#46;&#x63;&#x6f;&#x6d;</a></p>

      <h4>How to Cite</h4>
      <p>AWS Public Blockchain Data was accessed on <code>DATE</code> from https://registry.opendata.aws/aws-public-blockchain. </p>

      <h4 name="usageexamples">Usage Examples</h4>
        <h5 class="dataatwork-category">Publications</h5>
        <ul class="dataatwork-list">
          <li>
            <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/access-bitcoin-and-ethereum-open-datasets-for-cross-chain-analytics/" class="aws-link" target="_none">Access Bitcoin and Ethereum open datasets for cross-chain analytics</a> by Oliver Steffmann, Bhaskar Ravat, Sreeji Gopal, and Stefan Dicker</a>
            <br>
            
            
          </li>          <li>
            <a href="https://repost.aws/articles/ARpnBONglsT2e6D-hZZmxVvA/exploring-arbitrum-data-analyze-l2-activity-with-aws-public-blockchain-datasets" class="" target="_none">Exploring Arbitrum Data: Analyze L2 Activity with AWS Public Blockchain Datasets</a> by Simon Goldberg, Everton Fraga</a>
            <br>
            
            
          </li>          <li>
            <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/econres/notes/feds-notes/primary-and-secondary-markets-for-stablecoins-20240223.html" class="" target="_none">FEDS Notes - Primary and Secondary Markets for Stablecoins</a> by Cy Watsky, Jeffrey Allen, Hamzah Daud, Jochen Demuth, Daniel Little, Megan Rodden, Amber Seira</a>
            <br>
            
            
          </li>          <li>
            <a href="https://repost.aws/articles/AR3gztQGeSS8CfaKNNeyYwsQ" class="" target="_none">New datasets added to the AWS Public Blockchain Datasets — available for analytics and research</a> by Everton Fraga, Simon Goldberg</a>
            <br>
            
            
          </li>          <li>
            <a href="https://repost.aws/articles/ARg_zMIXlhTG2hSDFZDfF6hQ/unlocking-xrp-ledger-data-comprehensive-analysis-with-aws-public-blockchain-datasets" class="" target="_none">Unlocking XRP Ledger Data: Comprehensive Analysis with AWS Public Blockchain Datasets</a> by Simon Goldberg, Everton Fraga</a>
            <br>
            
            
          </li>        </ul>

    </div>
    <div class="col-md-5 col-md-offset-1">
      <h3>Resources on AWS</h3>
      <ul class="resource-list">
